WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.100
Yo! Crackheads! Woo!

00:00:07.566 --> 00:00:09.100
I guess they know we’re coming.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:11.300
Alright, that’s the block right here.

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:14.000
Be cool, don’t… you know.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.733
What?

00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:15.733
Err, nothing.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.300
Yo, what the fuck?

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.166
Yo, what's up? Y’all tryna smoke?

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.200
No. Y’all know Boobie?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.900
Boobie, huh? Yeah, he ain’t here, though.

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.700
Well, we're picking something up for him.

00:00:31.366 --> 00:00:32.433
You know anything about that?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.333
Yeah. Go inside and ask for Raymond, bruh.

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:39.700
Appreciate it.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.233
Like, might have to fuck around
and shake some shit, know I’m saying?

00:00:53.566 --> 00:00:55.933
Eh, fo sho. Yeah, yeah. Mmm hmm.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.400
Man… I don't even wanna hear that shit.

00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:00.500
Hey.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.266
Like, I don't even wanna hear that shit.

00:01:03.266 --> 00:01:04.100
Hold up, bruh.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.466
Yo. Ya’ll need something?

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.533
Raymond?

00:01:08.533 --> 00:01:10.566
Nah. Whatchu want?

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.566
Boobie sent us for a pickup.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.633
Aight, aight.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:16.833
Yo! We going up.

00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:21.233
Right inside.

00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:37.666
You said you was here for a pickup or a drop off?

00:01:38.066 --> 00:01:38.600
Pick up.

00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.633
Straight up, first door on the right.

00:01:49.933 --> 00:01:50.400
Yep.

00:01:58.066 --> 00:01:59.100
How you doing, big guy?

00:02:00.966 --> 00:02:01.833
Buddy…

00:02:11.433 --> 00:02:12.766
This has gotta be the door, right?

00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:13.400
Looks like it.

00:02:20.466 --> 00:02:21.300
What you want?

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.833
Yo, is Raymond around?

00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:24.100
Nah, never heard of him.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.733
Yo, we’re here to pick up. For Boobie.

00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:29.900
Aight, hold up.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.500
Yo, Ray! These two say they’re for Boobie.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.733
I already told that motherfucker what the fuck going on, man.

00:02:43.266 --> 00:02:45.066
He seriously sent y’all over here right now?

00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:46.566
We’re just here to collect, man.

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:47.966
Why he ain’t come to collect?

00:02:48.366 --> 00:02:49.566
You ain’t ask yourselves that?

00:02:50.566 --> 00:02:51.500
No.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.000
Look, we could go back empty handed.

00:02:54.566 --> 00:02:57.000
My partner's off the grid right now, you feel me?

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.500
Until I figure out where the fuck he at
and what the fuck going on

00:03:01.233 --> 00:03:02.600
we in a holding pattern right here.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.166
So Boobie knows all this, right?

00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:05.800
Yeah, he fucking knows.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.733
Problem is he only worried about himself.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:11.900
Yo, phone.

00:03:14.466 --> 00:03:18.266
Let me tell y’all something,
at this point I really don’t give a fuck.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:20.833
Ay, pack that shit up.

00:03:21.766 --> 00:03:24.166
Yo Ray, it’s him. Ernesto.

00:03:24.166 --> 00:03:25.000
Put it on speakerphone.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:25.800
<i>Raymond.<i>

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.566
Yo, Nesto!

00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:27.533
<i>Raymond, Raymond.<i>

00:03:27.533 --> 00:03:28.500
Where the fuck you at?

00:03:28.933 --> 00:03:32.500
<i>Óyeme, mi hermano, we got a situation happening.<i>

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.500
<i>Our friends on the task force are on their way.<i>

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.933
<i>They say they’re paying you a visit
so just let them take whatever they want, okay?<i>

00:03:38.933 --> 00:03:40.700
What the fuck you talking about?

00:03:41.033 --> 00:03:42.666
You know I got a nigga outside yo momma house, right?

00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:45.500
<i>Raymond, listen very closely, cabrón.<i>

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.233
<i>Raymond.<i>

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:49.966
The fuck is that?

00:03:49.966 --> 00:03:52.400
Hey, yo, Ray! It’s twelve! They tooled up and everything!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:52.900
<i>Raymond?<i>

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.200
Let’s get these workers out of here, man!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.166
Ah, shit!

00:03:55.466 --> 00:03:56.800
Wrong way, this way.

00:03:56.866 --> 00:03:57.866
Come on, come on!

00:03:57.866 --> 00:03:58.833
Move, move!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:01.466
I always been there for you.

00:04:03.966 --> 00:04:05.133
But this what I get?

00:04:05.366 --> 00:04:07.066
Police! Don't fucking move!

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.333
<i>It is what it is, my friend.<i>

00:04:11.966 --> 00:04:12.933
Holy shit!

00:04:12.933 --> 00:04:13.700
Stay down!

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:14.933
Yeah, I know.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.166
Come on, we need to find a way out.

00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:25.333
I got Boobie’s bricks.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.833
Fuck Boobie! We gotta get out of this.

00:04:39.066 --> 00:04:40.666
Lu, push up. Stay with me.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.266
Lu, cover!

00:04:45.733 --> 00:04:46.266
On it!

00:04:56.833 --> 00:04:59.200
What the fuck is going on here?!

00:04:59.433 --> 00:05:00.766
Fuck, it’s him!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.933
Can’t you fucking handle a bunch of street pushers?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.933
Hey man, this ain’t even loaded!

00:05:06.933 --> 00:05:08.866
Aww, too bad!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.000
Clean this shit up!

00:05:14.866 --> 00:05:16.066
It’s fucking Méndez!

00:05:16.433 --> 00:05:19.433
Yep. You think he saw us?

00:05:19.433 --> 00:05:20.900
No. He couldn’t have.

00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:24.266
Oh, coño.

00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:26.633
Yo, they got more cops coming in from downstairs.

00:05:26.633 --> 00:05:27.833
Get in here ‘fore they get yo ass!

00:05:28.133 --> 00:05:28.666
Thanks, man.

00:05:28.666 --> 00:05:30.766
Wh- Raymond, what’s going. What the fuck going on?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.566
What the fuck y’all doing in here?

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:36.000
You ain’t hear all that outside? Now, now just hold on a minute.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.366
"Hold on"? You got motherfuckers running up in my house.

00:05:39.366 --> 00:05:41.666
You are not allowed to just come in here.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.066
Every time I try to find some peace it’s something else!

00:05:45.066 --> 00:05:45.933
And that’s my fault?

00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:51.533
My AC! Don’t you climb out my motherfucking window!

00:05:51.533 --> 00:05:53.133
Aunt Tee! C’mon now!

00:05:52.166 --> 00:05:55.200
Easy. Shit!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:24.566
Hey.

00:06:24.566 --> 00:06:25.366
Hey, Jay.

00:06:25.633 --> 00:06:27.666
I bought these. What do you think?

00:06:27.666 --> 00:06:29.400
I can buy my own clothes, you know.

00:06:29.733 --> 00:06:32.600
Sure you can. But would they look that good?

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.166
Yeah, yeah. Okay.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.700
You know Brian wants us there for cocktails.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.800
Uh-huh.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.033
You know what you’re gonna wear yet?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.800
Relax, Jay.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.366
Okay, which do you think?

00:06:47.366 --> 00:06:49.866
Uhh… sequins?

00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:51.533
Sequins?

00:06:51.866 --> 00:06:53.166
Okay, the other one.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:58.666
You know, what you're wearing right now
looks pretty good, so… You wanna head out?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.200
I don’t wanna be late.

00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:03.333
Yeah, alright. Just gimme a few seconds.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:27.333
Does life feel hopeless?

00:07:27.333 --> 00:07:30.066
Are you constantly searching for a way out?

00:07:30.066 --> 00:07:34.033
Luckily for you, those days are over thanks to Angstipan!

00:07:34.566 --> 00:07:38.433
Ah, the great outdoors. Nature’s playground.

00:07:38.433 --> 00:07:41.500
A carnival of infinite possibilities.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:45.333
Overflowing with creatures great and small.

00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:47.500
Magnificent and proud.

00:07:48.633 --> 00:07:49.633
Hungry?

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.366
Not anymore.

00:07:52.366 --> 00:07:55.200
Mouthwatering meats from the open range

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.766
topped off with our world famous buns.

00:08:00.233 --> 00:08:01.033
Ready.

00:08:01.766 --> 00:08:03.500
Damn. Worth the wait.

00:08:14.866 --> 00:08:16.433
Here we go, finally.

00:08:16.633 --> 00:08:20.133
Okay, you’re wound up a little tight. What’s up?

00:08:20.133 --> 00:08:23.066
Nothing, I just don’t like being late.

00:08:23.466 --> 00:08:24.500
We’re not that late.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.766
Brian’s doing us a favor, you know?
We need this intro, Lu.

00:08:27.766 --> 00:08:28.600
I get it.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.066
You know, we’re in some deep fucking shit.

00:08:31.633 --> 00:08:33.233
I get that too.

00:08:33.233 --> 00:08:37.066
Who is this guy?
You know, besides Brian’s old cellmate.

00:08:37.066 --> 00:08:38.433
I know as much as you.

00:08:38.433 --> 00:08:42.000
Cal might have said he was like former
Dominican intelligence or something.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.866
Damn.

00:08:42.866 --> 00:08:43.833
What?

00:08:43.833 --> 00:08:46.066
Just kinda wish we weren’t running late.

00:08:46.733 --> 00:08:48.100
Really, huh?

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:50.466
What? I didn’t know all this.

00:08:50.466 --> 00:08:53.800
Relationships are about communication, Jay.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.133
Sure, yeah I’m sorry.

00:08:56.066 --> 00:08:58.333
Where you at, Vice City girls?

00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:00.933
Fuck, oh no! Argh-uh!

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.433
What did I fucking say?

00:09:15.166 --> 00:09:16.533
What the hell are you doing?

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:18.100
You seeing this?

00:09:18.366 --> 00:09:20.066
Well look who's back.

00:09:34.233 --> 00:09:34.833
What?

00:09:35.066 --> 00:09:38.666
Sometimes I’m just more comfortable
when I have to use a gun, you know?

00:09:38.766 --> 00:09:40.766
Just be charming, 'kay?

00:09:41.166 --> 00:09:42.233
Yeah.

00:09:42.366 --> 00:09:45.233
And don’t worry about Brian. Dude’s retired.

00:09:45.666 --> 00:09:49.600
I mean, look at Lori’s Snapmatic. Looks like they’re loving it.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.333
There they are. At the bar.

00:10:01.833 --> 00:10:06.866
Oh my god, as I live and breathe. Look at the two of you.

00:10:06.866 --> 00:10:08.533
Hey, Lori. It’s good to see you, Brian.

00:10:08.533 --> 00:10:09.166
Uh huh.

00:10:09.166 --> 00:10:11.100
Oh, c’mere, give us a hug.

00:10:11.733 --> 00:10:15.333
I told Brian, I thought you two were both dead for sure.

00:10:15.333 --> 00:10:19.533
Now, what have you gotten yourselves into?
I wanna know everything.

00:10:24.633 --> 00:10:26.400
I don’t know what this is.

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:28.866
Look, I was just sightseeing with my girl.

00:10:28.866 --> 00:10:30.833
Do tourists carry these?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.233
You fucking…

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:34.233
Shut up!

00:10:34.766 --> 00:10:35.600
Hold on.

00:10:37.666 --> 00:10:39.300
This is so fucked!

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.633
Well, Brian was quite the stud back in the day.

00:10:43.633 --> 00:10:45.066
Was?!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.100
Wait…

00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:47.966
What’s up?

00:10:47.966 --> 00:10:49.933
That job, it has to be done tonight.

00:10:49.933 --> 00:10:51.133
Tonight?

00:10:51.133 --> 00:10:55.866
He wants it on the quiet. He only wants one of you.

00:10:55.866 --> 00:10:56.633
Well.

00:10:56.633 --> 00:10:57.700
You know.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:58.900
I don't mind.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:10:59.866
I mean, I…

00:10:59.866 --> 00:11:01.266
If you wanted to.

00:11:01.766 --> 00:11:02.800
I’m gonna go.

00:11:03.566 --> 00:11:06.466
Enjoy your dinner, guys. I’ll be back for dessert.

00:11:06.466 --> 00:11:08.366
Well, I’ll walk you out, I need the ladies.

00:11:08.366 --> 00:11:10.500
Yeah, let’s take in the view.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.900
I never get to smoke these in front of Lori.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:24.800
I ever tell you about uh… the uh, fairground that
rolled into my home town when I was a kid?

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:25.800
I don’t think so.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:29.400
They had bale mazes and Ferris wheel.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.766
Hell, it was the highlight of the god damn summer for us kids.

00:11:32.766 --> 00:11:34.366
Everybody, hands where we can see them!

00:11:34.366 --> 00:11:37.800
And they had this beautiful carousel.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:44.000
One night we snuck in and a buddy of mine, he got it working.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.700
Look what the law chased in.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.833
The locals are feisty!

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:49.733
Leonida, baby.

00:11:49.733 --> 00:11:53.566
Then he cranked the speed up so fast we thought we was flying.

00:11:53.566 --> 00:11:54.533
What now?

00:11:56.233 --> 00:12:02.033
It started going faster and faster and
it was getting harder to hold on and I said "well shit".

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.700
"That ain’t good".

00:12:04.066 --> 00:12:04.666
Get down!

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:04.933
Watch out!

00:12:04.666 --> 00:12:06.266
And I fucking jumped.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.100
Jimmy Canto stayed on.

00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:13.766
Cracked his head open. Died that night.

00:12:15.466 --> 00:12:16.200
You got a point?

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:22.900
Yeah, yeah. You gotta know when to get off, Jason.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:23.966
You hear me?

00:12:25.166 --> 00:12:27.066
Oh. Let's head back.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:32.866
<i>Hey.<i>

00:12:32.866 --> 00:12:37.033
Hey. Got this Raul guy’s car and
heading to the address he gave.

00:12:37.033 --> 00:12:38.966
<i>Nice. On my way.<i>

00:12:38.966 --> 00:12:41.900
Yo, so I’ve been thinking, and

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:45.700
I don’t think we should tell him about,
you know, our troubles. Not just yet.

00:12:46.033 --> 00:12:47.366
<i>Thought that was the whole point of this?<i>

00:12:47.366 --> 00:12:50.766
Look, he could sell us out.
Or put a bullet through our heads.

00:12:50.766 --> 00:12:53.633
I mean seriously,
what reason do we have to trust this guy?

00:12:54.066 --> 00:12:56.300
<i>Alright, so how you wanna play it?<i>

00:12:56.300 --> 00:13:00.900
Slow play. Just say,
"Hi, nice to meet you. Here's your car."

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:05.600
"Where's our payment?" "Please let us know
about any further criminal opportunities."

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.000
<i>Ok. See you there.<i>

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:08.766
Yep.

00:13:10.533 --> 00:13:11.800
You miss me?

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.133
I’ve been busy. You gonna text this guy?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.933
Dude could be a cop for all we know.

00:13:15.933 --> 00:13:18.833
He’s not a cop, alright? He’s just cautious.

00:13:19.533 --> 00:13:22.000
It’s probably why he survived so long. We could learn something.

00:13:22.933 --> 00:13:24.266
Maybe you could.

00:13:24.266 --> 00:13:26.333
Yeah, you’re the perfect criminal.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.633
Jason? Lucia?

00:13:30.633 --> 00:13:31.333
Yeah.

00:13:31.333 --> 00:13:32.100
Yeah.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:32.833
We gotta go.

00:13:33.133 --> 00:13:33.666
Go?

00:13:33.666 --> 00:13:35.833
Yeah, go. Like, right fucking now.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.366
What you think I needed a lift for?

00:13:38.366 --> 00:13:40.133
Shit. He’s cautious alright.

00:13:41.033 --> 00:13:46.466
In Spanish: Go, go! Goddamn psycho,
show me what kinda driver you are!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.300
Hey, bro, get your ass back here man.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:50.833
Huh?

00:13:50.833 --> 00:13:52.500
Come on, you gotta hold these fuckers off.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.933
I got a little something for you to play with.

00:13:56.633 --> 00:13:58.533
Here, you take this.

00:14:00.666 --> 00:14:02.166
It’s getting crowded here.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:07.300
I’m going to punch through to the freeway!

00:14:10.333 --> 00:14:12.300
Negative. Stay local.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:13.266
Ok.

00:14:14.233 --> 00:14:16.233
Jay, hang on!

00:14:22.366 --> 00:14:23.966
Don’t get us trapped in here, Lu!

00:14:23.966 --> 00:14:27.333
No, no, no. This is good. Keep cutting through.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.300
Back up into this alley here.

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:35.000
Ok.

00:14:43.333 --> 00:14:47.400
That’s it. Good. Ahora we just chill here for a minute.

00:14:49.466 --> 00:14:51.200
Fuckin’ shit show.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.266
You want me to take the wheel?

00:14:52.566 --> 00:14:54.100
What? No.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:59.033
Look, you think everything always
goes as planned, huh? No, mami, no.

00:14:59.033 --> 00:15:00.533
There will always be some kind of bullshit.

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:04.133
A professional adapts. Are you a professional, Lucia, hm?

00:15:04.766 --> 00:15:05.333
Of course.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:08.466
Good, I need a professional.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.133
In Spanish: Shit…

00:15:12.133 --> 00:15:13.033
I see him.

00:15:13.033 --> 00:15:14.900
I think he saw us too. Let’s go!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:19.400
In Spanish: Let's go!

00:15:21.333 --> 00:15:22.900
Move! Move it!

00:15:40.466 --> 00:15:41.700
Is this fucking real now?

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:49.566
<i>Shit. Don’t have eyes on suspect’s vehicle.<i>

00:15:54.733 --> 00:15:58.266
Okay, out. Don’t leave anything in here.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.633
Alright, Jason, we’re cargo.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:14.666
Copy.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.433
Maybe some warning next time?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.433
What should I tell you, to put it in your calendar?

00:16:22.433 --> 00:16:25.100
Friday morning, bank robbery. Come on.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.666
We pass the test?

00:16:29.233 --> 00:16:32.366
You did fine. We’re still alive.

00:16:39.966 --> 00:16:42.833
This could be the start of, uh, something good.

00:16:43.666 --> 00:16:45.033
Keep your phones on.

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.333
In Spanish: Oh, mamita! So nice to see you!

00:16:49.333 --> 00:16:50.233
Oh hey.

00:16:50.866 --> 00:16:53.200
Take me to the loot, baby. I need to see it!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:55.466
Does this mean we’re in his crew?

00:16:55.466 --> 00:16:57.133
Yeah, I think so.

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:58.900
You think he can help us?

00:16:59.366 --> 00:17:01.000
We don’t have any better ideas, do we?

00:17:02.133 --> 00:17:03.233
Where are we?

00:17:03.233 --> 00:17:04.666
Back in Bayside.

00:17:04.666 --> 00:17:05.933
Wanna take a look around?

00:17:19.166 --> 00:17:22.133
Elbows in tight, you wanna thrust!

00:17:26.833 --> 00:17:28.866
Oh y-yeah!

00:17:33.466 --> 00:17:35.466
Yo, Jay! What’s happening, baby?

00:17:33.966 --> 00:17:34.733
Yo…

00:17:35.466 --> 00:17:36.400
What’s up, man?

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.166
Loony! What's up, girl?

00:17:39.366 --> 00:17:41.733
Ass up! Booty, booty, booty, twerk!

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.666
Just try to keep it clean.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.233
To hell with you!

00:18:01.833 --> 00:18:03.333
Hey! I’m watching you.

00:18:05.933 --> 00:18:07.000
Cops are on their way.

00:18:11.933 --> 00:18:14.033
Oh shit! Who the fuck are you?

00:18:14.033 --> 00:18:15.066
What the fuck is this?

00:18:15.066 --> 00:18:16.766
Oh, the trunk challenge!

00:18:16.766 --> 00:18:19.133
Wait, did you steal my friend’s car?

00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:19.800
Yeah.

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:22.933
Holy shit, chat! What do I do?

00:18:22.933 --> 00:18:24.000
Jesus.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:25.733
Look, look, look, look, look. Look.

00:18:25.733 --> 00:18:27.733
The actual cops are chasing us.

00:19:04.566 --> 00:19:06.533
I bet you’d be real good at battle rapping, dog.

00:19:06.533 --> 00:19:07.333
Oh, yeah?

00:19:07.833 --> 00:19:10.966
Lucia, Jason. Come take a seat.

00:19:10.966 --> 00:19:13.200
I’m waiting on the ETA for the flight.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.366
Can I get you anything?

00:19:14.366 --> 00:19:16.033
Tea, coffee, champagne?

00:19:16.033 --> 00:19:17.633
Three more champagnes. Thank you.

00:19:17.633 --> 00:19:18.733
Be right back.

00:19:18.733 --> 00:19:20.933
Trust me, a slight buzz will only help you.

00:19:21.166 --> 00:19:24.733
So Val, I know it’s a party but we are working, right?

00:19:24.733 --> 00:19:30.233
The job is Andrés de León. Protect him but keep him in line.

00:19:30.233 --> 00:19:33.833
Gas him up. Boost his ego. Make him feel good about himself.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:34.800
Babysit.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:35.433
Mhm.

00:19:35.733 --> 00:19:40.433
Hey! There is a sight for sore eyes. Tina! What’s up, chula?

00:19:40.433 --> 00:19:44.333
Andrés! It's been forever, how is everything?

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:45.633
Ah, man, it’s been non-stop.

00:19:45.633 --> 00:19:48.133
Lucia, Jason. Please meet Andrés de León.

00:19:48.133 --> 00:19:50.600
Sorry guys, I’m a hugger. I’m a hugger, come in here, get in here!

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:51.066
Oh.

00:19:51.066 --> 00:19:52.900
Yes! Alright!

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:57.066
Beautiful, beautiful, yes. Gorgeous! Alright, strong. Good job.

00:19:57.066 --> 00:19:58.233
Should we go, gentlemen?

00:19:58.233 --> 00:19:59.666
I guess you're the driver?

00:19:59.366 --> 00:19:59.900
Sure.

00:19:59.666 --> 00:20:00.566
Alright, let’s go.

00:20:00.566 --> 00:20:02.233
Ah, c’mon.

00:20:02.233 --> 00:20:03.566
Alright. We’re good.

00:20:03.566 --> 00:20:05.033
Ah fuck it, you ready for this party bro?

00:20:05.033 --> 00:20:06.333
I don’t know, maybe.

00:20:06.333 --> 00:20:06.900
Alright.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:07.800
What do you mean "maybe"?

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.166
I’m ready for a party
I don’t know about this party.

00:20:10.166 --> 00:20:11.600
Oh shit, okay.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.966
Hey driver, what was your name again?

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.633
In Spanish: Assholes! We're coming!

00:20:37.166 --> 00:20:37.733
Alright.

00:20:37.733 --> 00:20:38.700
Here we go.

00:20:42.466 --> 00:20:43.233
Woo!

00:20:43.766 --> 00:20:45.300
Welcome. How was your flight, sir?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.566
Yeah, yeah, real good time!

00:20:46.566 --> 00:20:48.566
Hey, those waitresses were all NDA’d, yeah?

00:20:48.566 --> 00:20:49.866
The flight attendants? Yes, of course.

00:20:49.866 --> 00:20:52.166
NDA after the fact? That’s a rookie move, bro.

00:20:52.166 --> 00:20:53.833
And you guys got our room sorted?

00:20:53.833 --> 00:20:57.233
Yes, it’s all ready for you. 
24th floor executive conference room.

00:20:57.233 --> 00:20:59.233
Perfect! Let’s go freshen up, bro.

00:20:59.233 --> 00:21:00.166
Let’s do it!

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.733
Hey, honey, so a couple of Elonzo’s producer friends are in town

00:21:03.733 --> 00:21:06.400
and we’re gonna do a deep dive into my creative roadmap.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:08.766
So, we’ll be up in the conference room doing a little business hang

00:21:08.766 --> 00:21:10.633
you know, think-tank stuff. 'Kay?

00:21:10.633 --> 00:21:12.166
Seriously? Right now?

00:21:12.166 --> 00:21:13.733
Yeah, baby, you snooze you lose!

00:21:13.733 --> 00:21:15.133
In Spanish: Unbelievable.

00:21:15.133 --> 00:21:19.033
Petra, can I introduce you to Andrés’ new security detail?

00:21:19.033 --> 00:21:23.600
Jason and Lucia, this is Petra Navarro, COO of Megamundo.

00:21:23.166 --> 00:21:24.100
Yes, good.

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:25.066
Can I take you up?

00:21:25.066 --> 00:21:28.066
Yes, please. Let’s go. I don’t want
to spend the whole night in the lobby.

00:21:32.033 --> 00:21:35.433
Let him do what he does, then I want him down here, ok?

00:21:35.433 --> 00:21:35.966
You got it.

00:21:35.966 --> 00:21:37.400
In Spanish: Evening, ladies.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.233
Gustavo, I want you to meet Lucia.

00:21:40.233 --> 00:21:43.200
She’s part of the new security detail that we hired for Andrés.

00:21:56.633 --> 00:21:59.100
<i>Some security guy just took my guns. <i>

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:00.600
It’s a good thing you’re good with your hands.

00:22:00.966 --> 00:22:02.966
These guys seem to have it covered. We should be fine.

00:22:02.966 --> 00:22:03.933
<i>Okay.<i>

00:22:04.633 --> 00:22:06.033
Do it bro! Do it, do it, do it!

00:22:06.033 --> 00:22:07.333
Here I come!

00:22:10.633 --> 00:22:12.133
A private meeting. Don’t come in!

00:22:12.133 --> 00:22:13.266
Hey, Andrés.

00:22:13.266 --> 00:22:16.200
Whoa whoa, hey hey, its ok it’s ok,
he’s my guy it’s my guy it’s my guy.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:19.100
Hey, buddy. Just uh, haha, christening the new building.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:20.100
Hey, man.

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:22.766
Oh, sorry to interrupt.

00:22:22.766 --> 00:22:27.833
Aye, man can you run and get us a bottle of tequila,
some sparkling water, a few beers you know

00:22:27.833 --> 00:22:30.666
just a selection of shit to drink, yeah? Thanks, buddy. Yeah.

00:22:30.666 --> 00:22:34.066
Uh huh, so they just called and
asked me to bring you down to the party now.

00:22:34.066 --> 00:22:36.733
Petra wants you. There’s some big speech happening.

00:22:36.733 --> 00:22:40.133
No! No fuck, fuck that shit. Ha, fuck that.

00:22:39.333 --> 00:22:43.500
Yeah, sorry no. Hard pass, man. We’re on a roll here, you know.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.500
Frontal cortex is in overdrive, I mean, how many
ideas did I just have in the last five minutes, bro?

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:49.333
So many, bro, so fucking many.

00:22:49.333 --> 00:22:52.400
It’s like the band is back together
and I just met these fucking guys.

00:22:53.066 --> 00:22:54.066
C’mon, guys.

00:22:55.666 --> 00:22:56.966
Hello, everyone.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:01.800
I just want to thank you all for coming here
tonight to join us in celebrating the opening

00:23:01.800 --> 00:23:07.966
of Megamundo’s first corporate headquarters on American soil.

00:23:08.766 --> 00:23:12.900
We all did this together. As a family.

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:15.633
The party’s over!

00:23:16.366 --> 00:23:18.833
Everybody! On the ground! Now!

00:23:18.833 --> 00:23:19.433
In Spanish: What the hell?

00:23:19.433 --> 00:23:20.366
Protect the asset.

00:23:20.633 --> 00:23:21.433
In Spanish: Shit!

00:23:21.433 --> 00:23:23.433
Move, move, move! Move, move, move, move!

00:23:53.266 --> 00:23:54.200
Move!

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.333
Hey, hey, hey, hey! Give me the phone.

00:23:56.333 --> 00:23:58.533
Who am I going to call? I’m not stupid.

00:23:58.533 --> 00:24:00.833
<i>Sup, guys. How’s it going down there?<i>

00:24:01.133 --> 00:24:02.266
Who the fuck is this?

00:24:02.266 --> 00:24:03.866
<i>We’ll talk more later, okay?<i>

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:05.466
In Spanish: What the fuck?

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:08.833
In Spanish: We got a problem.

00:24:08.833 --> 00:24:10.433
In Spanish: Shit, shit, grenade!

00:24:15.466 --> 00:24:18.166
Nice distraction, Jay. A bit dramatic.

00:24:18.166 --> 00:24:20.966
<i>You're welcome. Going upstairs. He’s got Andrés.<i>

00:24:20.966 --> 00:24:22.933
Shit, okay. On my way.

00:24:33.233 --> 00:24:35.633
Lu? Lu? Fuck.

00:24:35.633 --> 00:24:37.033
In Spanish: Motherfucker, fucking fuck!

00:24:37.033 --> 00:24:38.466
Not the face, man! Not the face!

00:24:38.466 --> 00:24:39.100
Where’s the money?

00:24:39.100 --> 00:24:40.100
I don't know!

00:24:39.400 --> 00:24:40.800
Where’s the fucking money?

00:24:40.900 --> 00:24:43.033
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait! Ahhh!

00:24:43.033 --> 00:24:45.566
I don't know, man! They don't tell me shit!

00:24:45.566 --> 00:24:46.866
Ughhhh!

00:24:47.266 --> 00:24:47.933
Jay dog!

00:25:29.066 --> 00:25:29.833
Ahhhggg!!

00:25:32.200 --> 00:25:35.133
Hurts, right? Try wearing them, bitch.

00:25:39.000 --> 00:25:40.133
In Spanish: I don't think so, bitch!

00:25:40.133 --> 00:25:41.166
Ah, shit!

00:25:47.433 --> 00:25:50.700
Might not feel like it but these are your glory days.

00:25:52.133 --> 00:25:53.800
The salad years, you know?

00:25:54.166 --> 00:25:56.366
Nothing is going to beat who you are now.

00:25:57.033 --> 00:26:00.233
You can’t see all the fucked up shit that’s looming on the horizon.

00:26:03.100 --> 00:26:04.266
Enjoy this, dude.

00:26:04.966 --> 00:26:07.200
If this right now was all that there is…

00:26:07.200 --> 00:26:08.300
all the time.

00:26:09.833 --> 00:26:11.400
It would be perfect.

00:26:14.300 --> 00:26:15.266
Trust me.

00:26:28.100 --> 00:26:32.066


00:26:32.066 --> 00:26:43.833


